{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "6903ac38e5feb87055dc88437106c2920307b8b938b4b9f7e17c33df39900e38", "ja": "その先の物語", "zh": "之后的故事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2468cd170feade628ee951d21e5434f95fe7abe39d90b21dedd086ff3a7344b7", "ja": "夜想令嬢のファンイベント開催が決定。\nそこで朗読劇を上演する事になった夜想令嬢\nのメンバー達。恵美は過去の舞台映像を見て\n泣き、朋花と「今度こそ幸せになろう！」と\n話すのだが……。", "zh": "夜想令嬢确定将举办粉丝活动。\n夜想令嬢的成员们决定在活动中上演朗读剧。\n惠美在看完过去的舞台录像后哭了出来，\n虽然和朋花说着“这次一定要获得幸福！”，\n然而……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1000_020meg", "source_sha256": "76f401cd0e0db60b1eca06c2b7576beb3dbcbf2d67408494d3ef290221929721", "ja": "ううっ……。幸せに……\n幸せになりたかっただけなのに……！", "zh": "呜呜……幸福……\n明明只是想获得幸福……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "43a511115113c4d0a9431228df05e7acf885b1673f37d5771646d38ee44ee6bb", "ja": "恵美さん……泣いているんですか～？", "zh": "惠美……你在哭吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "24cd9a4566736618c862476bec40c8c9a2be55d8e8880b813ce9742ce31dc74b", "ja": "練習の時にも泣いていましたわね。", "zh": "练习的时候也哭过呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "f4c443e146909ba50cfc030839f2db630d4a3766a31f2c3e18398d864b99d0e9", "ja": "本番でも泣いてなかった？", "zh": "正式演出时，你不是也哭了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "28b8708e82335b7a98ccda18b5a3ed19d09c0d4d8aa1e13fb35d03db7a28e23c", "ja": "恵美さん。次の朗読劇で、私たち、\n今度こそ幸せになりましょうね～♪", "zh": "惠美。在下一场朗读剧中，我们\n这次一定要获得幸福哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "0e8a3da04b9cb5bd959fe1cacd47adb0ce549067d6a44e618c251f6fc00de0ac", "ja": "クリス～……じゃなかった。朋花ぁ～……。\nうん、幸せになろっ！", "zh": "克里斯～……不对。朋花～……。\n嗯，我们一定要获得幸福！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0c2f4038f1c8992352e4048f538b5986c7523e892be50daa4dc592f179ac1060", "ja": "幸せに……うーん……。", "zh": "幸福……唔——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "81a3e3841d188ae173154c1b3769a14e17fdfc82b0564743e12e81b4c5c4c396", "ja": "{$P$}くん、何か言った？", "zh": "{$P$}，你刚才说了什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "da942bf56826287f95d8c58c24be63916e8364fc33f084a577944f90e7483e32", "ja": "いや、何も。……さて、前にも話したとおり、近々\n夜想令嬢のファンイベントを開催する事になった。", "zh": "没，没什么。……好了，正如之前提到过的，近期\n我们决定要举办夜想令嬢的粉丝活动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "15a8bca485bbf34597ba1187bfe188e57c12bd54741b12e7fbd739133a82d854", "ja": "早速、イベントで上演する朗読劇の台本が届いた！\n本番に向けて、みんなで稽古していく予定だ。", "zh": "很快，活动上要上演的朗读剧剧本送到了！\n接下来打算大家一起为正式演出排练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "cdb4f104bb327c38912ff4a88c010dba75843d0bb6b0f0ab102ff538ae627a47", "ja": "台本が届くと、いよいよ！　という感じがしますわね。\nそれで、どんな内容ですの？", "zh": "剧本一送到，就让人切实感受到终于要开始了呢。\n所以，内容是什么样的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "95bbb58e3ef628af61f787b91d747537c17da3d0d72b60bc42afeb77a00628d3", "ja": "口で説明するより、実際に読んでもらった方が良いと\n思うので……今から、目を通してもらおうかと。", "zh": "我觉得与其用嘴说明，不如实际读一遍更好……所以，想请你现在先过目一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "fb65dfe491e30e291d9d7c48e950fa0bfe45d0ef410e9285c1086c7fc2811f45", "ja": "いいわよ！　どれどれ～……。", "zh": "好啊！我来看看～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "c0dc98b8f16d7d3ffb2404f8a5d67e4fddb291e90b8519be64e9cb48b6c7cdf6", "ja": "エドガーとクリス、アレクサンドラとノエル。\nそれぞれの旅のシーンから始まるんですのね……。", "zh": "埃德加和克里斯、亚历山德拉和诺埃尔。\n是从他们各自的旅途场景开始的呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "d0feb6e00ca2cff67c2668f78e3c200339367a9897932d390675836a6b8a5580", "ja": "いた……っ！", "zh": "好痛……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "b314e6b8199fdf0bf8a49fc42051a308b967470d6f3e8e2cfb2ea63383bd539c", "ja": "クリス……傷が痛むのか？\nあいつら、ひどいことを……。", "zh": "克里斯……伤口很痛吗？\n那些家伙，竟然做出这么过分的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "fbf7702f640749888dbca230742c75f43f2998f15dd53f9cd53dcba245706300", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、エドガー。私は歩けます。\n次の街に着いたら、ひと休みしましょう。", "zh": "没关系的，埃德加。我还能走。\n等到了下一座城镇，我们再休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "8feecfc446d15fa8d1c172f53b724ddc64d35a88abb6dd5f88fa8a3b69dd8ace", "ja": "ごめんな、クリス。オレが、\n人の血は飲みたくないなんて言ったばかりに……。", "zh": "对不起，克里斯。都怪我刚才说了不想喝人血……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "681d630e75dadea72325c4d4c0133f21c0436d09071b25fbbb54047e29dc63f1", "ja": "エドガー……。", "zh": "艾德嘉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "3b4db4a8404115661053c8e2e57f5ccd267d86d8b228dcb8f801d7664cecbac9", "ja": "だって、そうだろ？　人の血さえ飲んでいれば、\nこのくらいの傷、すぐに治るはずだ。", "zh": "因为就是这样吧？只要喝人血，这种程度的伤应该马上就能治好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "52484d4eee4e760e1760e35ac019c998286ba3d0b4453803fc54ca40532dbbc5", "ja": "……ううん。ケガをすることだって、\nなかったかもしれないのに……。", "zh": "……不对。说不定根本就不会受伤……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "f1cbccb0a9efd637b4cb955c0cc05707a0e81bbdac719137e4b5d8b0ceaf810f", "ja": "オレ、足手まといになってばかりだ……。", "zh": "我总是在拖后腿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "59f8adb3d68cc9b65e9ffe62b37b4f9a7fb6c0ed782c5d38a7be1dad22a962ea", "ja": "……いいえ、エドガー。\nそれは違います。", "zh": "……不，埃德加。\n不是那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "c7e4d60443ab59d154beaa7036a14aadd57e0679d13240563a3844839c2b8aa0", "ja": "クリス……？", "zh": "克里斯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1025_031tom", "source_sha256": "80d1d6c6f33d10b81b99b6f4aec79885d8eb417b5475b4aa8cdc17df311b58fd", "ja": "貴方がいるから、私はこうしてここにいる。\n……まだ、生きていたいと思えるのです。", "zh": "正因为有你，我才能这样待在这里。\n……我才能觉得，自己还想活下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1026_031tom", "source_sha256": "661dfca74321f58f9990c79edfa34215809f4df72b6523e8c8ad638bc3ae121d", "ja": "大丈夫。貴方が傍にいてくれる限り、\n私は負けたりなどしません。", "zh": "没事的。只要你陪在我身边，\n我就绝不会认输。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1027_031tom", "source_sha256": "04d4f5c34b71ae3a343eae5849b28d8e98d67a65aaed5f6c935a4f20b6932c8a", "ja": "人間にも、ヴァンパイアにもです。", "zh": "不论是对人类，还是对吸血鬼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "17b1f9ba364cf75e718b51e5c50a84d4314c4a08b5ba1797b301bcf54f2ee0f6", "ja": "……ねえ、クリス。\nオレ、時々不安になるんだ……。", "zh": "……我说，克里斯。\n我有时会感到不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "85e7d8e0ee14de5c743b3a80a65938c182c1b8a00440aa7468e96ef933a8730f", "ja": "もしかしたら、オレたちの命と同じように……\nこの旅には、終わりがないんじゃないかって。", "zh": "说不定，就像我们的生命一样……\n这段旅途也根本没有尽头……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "36092c566d64742d24319775eeb247482f6b7e27a3c513fbcd74b0e4bf7ae8d5", "ja": "母さんの言った、約束の地なんて……\n本当は、どこにも……。", "zh": "妈妈说的那个约定之地……其实，根本就不存在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1031_031tom", "source_sha256": "b2228fe367eb3be0c29f5d66da1fc38bce6aad74efa261ce30ff629309fb75ae", "ja": "……もしそうだとしても、私は幸せですよ。\nこうして、貴方と旅をしていられるんですから。", "zh": "……即使真是那样，我也很幸福。\n因为我能像这样和您一起旅行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1033_se", "source_sha256": "4ff870822b28bbe6797ed97d0ad1a227fd85c79275c27792037f2db34669e60c", "ja": "ガタンッ……", "zh": "哐当……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1034_038chz", "source_sha256": "0fcfa0362a71c4ab9e4b64215c10d3aa3345bee43dacb7470051785ad329c5bb", "ja": "……。\nノエル……。", "zh": "……。\n\n诺艾尔……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1035_007ior", "source_sha256": "20fd0c25934b8c9dffe0769fd74ccbb8895ab2391fca34d5005698b2215361f5", "ja": "……あら、お姉さま。起きてらしたのね。", "zh": "……哎呀，姐姐大人。您已经醒了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1036_038chz", "source_sha256": "4a8427e31fa5fc468d94954796287c0769f9fdeb0d3095b07cbefb7ccb503d17", "ja": "お前……また……？", "zh": "你……又来了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1037_007ior", "source_sha256": "16a315804b3246d7f6f63ca012f93f0b4ab9fb60684206321cfe24e0a9248b99", "ja": "大丈夫よ、お姉さま。\n私、人を殺したりなんかしていないわ。", "zh": "没事的，姐姐大人。\n我可没有去杀人之类的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1038_007ior", "source_sha256": "12101d5c65584848582e72eb1e334ef1b23f4153abf6150ba8cdb8229f5f773c", "ja": "だからお姉さまは、何も心配しないで。\n私が必ず、守ってあげる……。", "zh": "所以姐姐什么都不用担心。我一定会保护你的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1040_038chz", "source_sha256": "537872cb1e1ea22c147c7eef263f4b7ac02b355677ed6b206c0a90a7cd466f45", "ja": "（ノエルを眠らせるための香は、もう残り少ない。\nそれに、だんだん効かなくなっているようだ）", "zh": "（让诺埃尔入睡的香已经所剩无几了。而且，似乎渐渐变得不那么有效了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1041_038chz", "source_sha256": "a691f5e4237a11873a14e4bb5201d182470fc198db1d4b7761ce59243a104975", "ja": "（私が眠ってしまうと、ノエルはひとり、外に出る。\n戻る度、血と死の匂いをまとわりつかせて……）", "zh": "（每当我睡着，诺艾尔就会独自出门。\n每次回来，身上都缠绕着血与死亡的气息……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_01_1042_038chz", "source_sha256": "c2f060e1969523b80e25f3416fd49efd8b6dcb4b8b85492393c84b66ecb2fc73", "ja": "（これ以上の罪を、ノエルに重ねさせたくはない。\nだが、私は……）", "zh": "（我不想让诺埃尔再背负更多罪孽。可是，我……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
